  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiko Samariya Ahabu wakala na ana mirongo sabaa. Jehu achiandika baruwa na achizihuma Samariya, kpwa akulu a mudzi, kpwa atumia na kpwa arezi a atungbwa a Ahabu. Baruwa yenye yaamba hivi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atawala a Samariya aogopha sana achiamba, “Hinyo afalume airi taayamuweza Jehu, swino hundamuwezaphi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo mkpwulu wa nyumba ya mfalume na muimirizi wa mudzi, ashirikiana na atumia anjina na arezi, achimphirikira Jehu ujumbe huno, “Swino hu atumwao na hu tayari kuhenda rorosi ndirohuambira. Ela tahundamuika mutu yeyesi kukala mfalume. Henda vyo uonavyo ni sawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu waandikira baruwa yanjina achiaambira, “Ichikala kpweli mu uphande wangu na mtayari kulunga malagizo gangu, nreherani hiku Jeziriili vitswa vya ana a mkpwulu wenu niviphahe muhondo saa dza zizi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyo ana mirongo sabaa a mfalume Ahabu aishi kpwa vilongozi a Samariya, ambao kala ni arezi ao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, baruwa iriphoafikira, aahala hinyo ana a mfalume na kpwakata vitswa osi mirongo sabaa. Atiya vitswa vyao kpwenye vikaphu na kumphirikira Jehu hiko Jeziriili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtumishi mmwenga wamlunga achimuamba, “Vitswa vya ana a mfalume tayari vikarehwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu waamba, “Viikeni photsi mafungu mairi kpwenye ryango ra mudzi, mviriche vikale hipho hadi ligundzu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligundzure ariphotuluka, waima na achiambira atu osi, “Mwimwi mu atu a haki. Mino náhenda fitina, nchimuolaga mkpwulu wangu. Ela ni ani achiyeaolaga hinya osi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi manyani kukala maneno gosi Mwenyezi Mlungu arigogomba kuhusu atu a Ahabu gakatimiya. Mwenyezi Mlungu akagahenda gosi arigogomba kutsupira mtumishiwe Elija.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hosea 1:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Jehu waolaga atu osi a nyumba ya Ahabu ariokala akasala, nao kala anaishi Jeziriili, phamwenga na akulue, asenae na alavyadzie-sadaka. Naye kayaricha hata mutu mmwenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Jehu wauka Jeziriili, achigbwira njira ya kuphiya Samariya. Ariphofika phatu phoihwa “Kambi ya Arisa,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakutana na abari a marehemu Ahaziya mfalume wa Juda achiauza, “Mwino mu ano ani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amjibu achiamba, “Swino hu abari a Ahaziya. Hukedza hiku kujambosa ana a mfalume na ana a Malikia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona achiamba, “Agbwireni achere moyo.” Agbwirwa achere moyo atu mirongo mine na airi achiolagbwa phephi na chisima cha “Kambi ya Arisa.” Takuna ariyesala hata mmwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Jehu ariphouka hipho, mo njirani wakutana na Jehonadabu mwana wa Rekabu, ariyekala aredza akutane naye. Jehu wamlamusa, chisha achimuuza; “Dze, u muaminifu kpwangu, dza nrivyo muaminifu kpwako?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehonadabu wamjibu achiamba, “Ehe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu achimuamba, “Ichikala ni kpweli, nipha mkpwono.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achimupha mkpwono na Jehu achimpandiza ndani ya gariye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achimuamba; “Huphiye ukadzionere vira nrivyo na chadi kpwa ajili ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.” Phahi, asafiri phamwenga kpwenye gariye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphofika Samariya, Jehu waolaga hara osi ariosala a nyumba ya Ahabu bila kuricha hata mmwenga wao, sawa na vira Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyomuambira Elija indakala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu waakusanya atu a Samariya na achiambira, “Mfalume Ahabu wamuhumikira Baali chidide tu, ela mino ndamuhumikira zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo niihirani manabii osi a Baali, alavyadzi-sadaka na osi anaomuabudu. Ni lazima chila mmwenga afike, mana nalonda kumlavira Baali sadaka kulu, na yeyesi ndiyekosa kufika andaolagbwa.” Iyo yakala ni njama ya Jehu ili aphahe kuaolaga afuasi osi a Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu achiamba, “Tangazani mkpwutano wa ibada ya Baali!” Tangazo richilaviwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Jehu waphirika habari tsi yosi ya Iziraeli. Osi ariokala anaabudu Baali akusanyika phamwenga takuna hata mmwenga ariyesala. Akpwedza osi na kuodzala kpwenye Nyumba ya kuvoya Baali kula pembe hadi pembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Jehu wamlagiza yuya ariyeimirira chumba cha nguwo za kuabudira achimuamba hivi, “Tuluza nguwo na uaphe atu osi anaohumikira Baali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muimirizi watuluza nguwo hizo, achiapha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Jehu wainjira kpwenye Nyumba ya kuvoya Baali achilungana na Jehonadabu na kuaambira ariokala ndani ya Nyumba ya Baali, “Lolani chila phatu na muhakikishe kukala ario himu ndani ya Nyumba ya kuvoya Baali ni hara anaomuabudu Baali macheye, na kukala taphana mutu yeyesi anayemuabudu Mwenyezi Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona wainjira phamwenga na Jehonadabu ili amlavire Baali sadaka za kuochwa na sadaka zanjina, Jehu kala akaika atu mirongo minane kondze ya Nyumba ya kuvoya Baali na achiapha malagizo higa, “Olagani atu hinya osi. Yeyesi ndiyemricha hata mmwenga wao achimbire andaripha kpwa maishage!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara tu Jehu ariphomala kulavya sadaka ya kuochwa, waambira arindzi na akulu, “Injirani muaolage osi. Musiriche hata mmwenga achimbire!” Phahi ainjira na panga zao tayari na achiaolaga osi, chisha atuluza nyufu zao kondze. Halafu ainjira kpwenye chumba cha ndani cha Nyumba ya kuvoya Baali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kutuluza nguzo yokala mo Nyumba ya Baali achiitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abananga nguzo phamwenga na Nyumba ya kuvoya Baali, achiigaluza Nyumba ya kuvoya Baali kukala choo, na hivi ndivyo vyokala hadi rero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
